WEBVTT

00:00:56.836 --> 00:01:02.036
we have to work with all the levers
of change simultaneously.

00:01:02.036 --> 00:01:03.956
That's the key point.

00:01:03.956 --> 00:01:07.636
So, cities, we have to engage with cities.

00:01:07.676 --> 00:01:08.836
That's great.

00:01:08.876 --> 00:01:10.036
Not enough.

00:01:10.076 --> 00:01:11.756
We have to engage with politicians.

00:01:11.756 --> 00:01:14.716
We have to engage
with the companies themselves.

00:01:14.756 --> 00:01:17.236
We have to create business coalitions.

00:01:17.596 --> 00:01:22.596
And we also have to empower citizens
so that they play their act.

00:01:23.076 --> 00:01:27.196
Ultimately, we know
that we have to create political space

00:01:27.236 --> 00:01:30.396
for stricter regulations for policy.